+# ── blob-GC reconcile (#245; one pass per `filestore.gc_interval_sec` window) ──
+# Fixed 1 replica, no HPA: the API's sweeper asks ONCE per window behind a
+# ScanLease and the coordinator coalesces overlapping asks, so one consumer is
