+# the live blob set from the REGISTERED models, and a consumer holding fewer
+# than the API would quarantine, then delete, every blob the missing models
+# reference — the runner refuses such a pass (the job reads FAILED, the log
+# names the missing models), and equal registries are what makes it run.
+#
+# Because it boots the API's composition, this pod needs what the API pod
+# needs AT BOOT — the same configmap, and the same mounts and privileges the
