+# `LocalProcessSandbox` mkdirs SANDBOX_ROOT (hence `scratch` below, so it does
+# not land on the container layer); `sandbox.isolation.enabled: true` needs the
+# CAP_SETUID/SETGID + cgroup grant `deployment.yaml` documents, on this pod too;
+# an `nfs_tree` durable store needs `/mnt/workspaces` here for the ws_census
+# figure to be real (an absent tree reads as zeros). Mirror whatever the
+# overlay adds to `rca-app` for those. It serves nothing and starts none of the
+# sweepers; the #219 inline→Binary migration it runs at boot is idempotent.
+#
+# Memory is the sizing that matters: for each blob-capable model the pass
+# holds EVERY ResourceMeta at once — indexed_data included, which on doc-chunk
+# / cluster-member is every row's embedding vectors (the Postgres meta store
